Consider the following method.

    public static int mystery(int[] arr, int lo, int hi)
    {
        if (lo > hi)
            return 0;
        if (lo == hi)
            return arr[lo];
        int mid = (lo + hi) / 2;
        int left = mystery(arr, lo, mid);
        int right = mystery(arr, mid + 1, hi);
        if (left > right)
            return left;
        return right;
    }

Assume the array nums is declared as follows.

    int[] nums = {4, 9, 2, 9, 7};

What value is returned by the call mystery(nums, 0, 4), and how many times in total is the method mystery called, including the initial call?
